{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"The board starts with four pieces in each hole. Choose a hole on your side and plant the pieces counterclockwise, passing the other player's stack. Place your last piece in your stack to take another turn. If it lands in an empty hole on your side, pick the pieces in the opposite hole. When one side is empty, the game ends and the remaining pieces go to another stack.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"mancala UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"mancala.copy.howAnswer","keys":["mancala.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"id","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Papan dimulai dengan empat biji di setiap lubang. Pilih lubang di sisi Anda dan tanamkan bijinya berlawanan dengan arah jarum jam, melewati gudang pemain lain. Letakkan biji terakhir Anda di gudang Anda untuk mengambil putaran lain. Jika itu mendarat di lubang kosong di sisi Anda, ambil biji di lubang berlawanan. Ketika satu sisi kosong, permainan berakhir dan biji yang tersisa pergi ke gudang lain.","record_id":"07dead9d05fe39f207b0a46d197b231979b7743078b8285c2adb6e0b23793401","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":2.8242942689999992,"source":"The board starts with four seeds in each pit. Choose a pit on your side and sow its seeds counter-clockwise, skipping the other player’s store. Land your last seed in your store to take another turn. If it lands in an empty pit on your side, capture the seeds in the opposite pit. When one side is empty, the game ends and the remaining seeds go to the other store.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"24989f6265660fd7d2d728fc496b155f089e0640e8905caa5716b2c51e6ae6b8","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Papan dimulai dengan empat biji di setiap lubang. Pilih lubang di sisi Anda dan tanamkan bijinya berlawanan dengan arah jarum jam, melewati gudang pemain lain. Letakkan biji terakhir Anda di gudang Anda untuk mengambil putaran lain. Jika itu mendarat di lubang kosong di sisi Anda, ambil biji di lubang berlawanan. Ketika satu sisi kosong, permainan berakhir dan biji yang tersisa pergi ke gudang lain.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
